					"type": "MainSpriteFont",
					"properties": {
						"text": "[color=663E54]continued:[/color]\n\n[color=b7abbf]then I posted one [color=9482a0]Spin[/color] piece with a lot of [color=9482a0]Contrast[/color] and people loved it. So I kept going, incorporating the bright colors in most of my pictures in No Paint since.[/color]\n \n[color=005D36]Alex:[/color]\n\n[color=b7abbf]How important is sharing your work with others, and how does that further influence your process?[/color]\n\n[color=663E54]Wilsans:[/color]\n\n[color=b7abbf]It doesn't really influence anything. I don't make these pictures to show them to others, even though it is super sick to post them and have people tell me how cool they are. I do it all for me. It's a nice side hobby, cause there's so much you can do with such little control. [/color]",
